# Icon sources (PNG) - never committed.
# The tray/battery artwork lives in assets/icon-sources/ and is turned into the
# embedded C++ tables by "compilation files/icons_to_base64.py"; only those
# generated .inc files are tracked, so the repository carries no binary art.
assets/icon-sources/*.png

